# fncall launches code that returns a result (the book, call-receivers): a body that ends without one -- answer 5.
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds the call main().
sub: main () (
    Vars:
        int: x 1
    Body:
        x := x + 1
)
    int: response fncall(Vars int Body)
main()
